error: rsjs boundary: `rsjs::server_only(...)` cannot declare or read `signal(...)`

       Why:
         Server-only slots are opaque SSR content. Declaring or reading rsjs state there would create client state that the hydrated island cannot see.

       Use one of:
         - Declare `signal`, `query`, or `mutation` handles before the template or in a normal rsjs slot.
         - Keep the server-only slot limited to plain server-rendered Proa content.

       Tracked feature:
         server_boundary.state_declaration
